Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.96,0:00:54.51,Announcement,,0,0,0,,The enemy is presently bombing the Bonomisaki Cape area.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.51,0:00:57.34,Announcement,,0,0,0,,All personnel, remain on standby in the shelter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.63,0:00:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What would the Gamilas want with this ancient battleship?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.47,0:00:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's them!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.95,0:00:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would they attack something like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.59,0:00:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Will we be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.97,0:01:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We're boarding that ship. We can't die here!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.93,0:01:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are they coming from?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.23,0:01:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,A carrier?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.01,0:02:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the Air Defense Forces.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.30,0:02:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Alpha Leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.68,0:02:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We've finished the welcoming party for our guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.22,0:02:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,OK, Alpha Leader. We've confirmed it from here, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.35,0:02:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Return to base immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.98,0:02:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.12,0:02:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Those idiots.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.20,0:02:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's your problem? You're leaving us here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.71,0:02:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's alive...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.92,0:02:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,This rusted old ship...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.55,0:03:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, be careful with that hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.85,0:03:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, he's glaring at us...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.60,0:03:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nice to be young. The radiation...\NWell, I'm sure it'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.86,0:04:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't be seeing you for a while, Mew.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.45,0:04:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, didn't you get the order to go, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.57,0:04:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.41,0:04:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,All over the world, energy sources are drying up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.29,0:04:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,To make matters worse, famine, riots, and poisonous spores
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.30,0:04:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,from those strange plants are destroying the planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.84,0:04:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We've very little time left...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.84,0:04:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that the enemy's discovered\Nour plan, when are we executing it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.10,0:04:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We've moved it up. We set sail in 72 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.10,0:04:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm told that most of the crew perished in the bombing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.86,0:04:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,There were no casualties during the bombing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.74,0:04:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the hero of the Second Battle of Mars.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.20,0:04:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you speak the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.87,0:04:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This plan is being executed under UN authority,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.08,0:04:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,but all the sectors are isolated from one another right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.83,0:05:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, we cannot help you directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.38,0:05:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Currently, it's very difficult for us, also.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.51,0:05:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Please... The entire world's hopes rest with the Yamato Plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.60,0:05:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it finally time?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.26,0:05:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The Izumo Plan entails our leaving Earth, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.89,0:05:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But we can't just abandon Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.07,0:06:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Men.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.36,0:06:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You have all been specially trained and selected for the Izumo Plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.24,0:06:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Today, I will formally announce your mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.45,0:06:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But it is not the Izumo Plan, which was to escape the Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.59,0:06:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I will explain. First, I'd like you to look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.30,0:06:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the video message we recovered during Operation M yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.47,0:06:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Starsha, of the planet Iscandar.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.43,0:06:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.48,0:06:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Your planet has been almost completely destroyed by the Gamilas.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.44,0:06:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Gamilas...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.78,0:06:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I learned of this one year ago,\Nand dispatched my sister Yurisha to Earth
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.74,0:06:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,with the plans for a Dimensional Wave Motion Engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.95,0:07:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just what we saw on Mars.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.71,0:07:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can understand and build it,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.46,0:07:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,come to Iscandar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.13,0:07:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Our planet holds a system
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.34,0:07:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,which can cleanse the pollution and rebuild your planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.26,0:07:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.52,0:07:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, I can no longer take it to Earth myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.81,0:07:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,So, she's an Iscandarian.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.23,0:07:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,She's pretty...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.90,0:07:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I have sent you the Wave Motion Core,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.36,0:07:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,the activation unit for the Dimensional Wave Motion Engine, with my other sister, Sasha.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.00,0:07:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe that you will overcome unknown dangers and reach Iscandar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.21,0:07:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Starsha, of the planet Iscandar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.55,0:07:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,One year ago, Earth received technological cooperation from Iscandar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.55,0:08:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And we have already completed a spaceship capable of interstellar flight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.31,0:08:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Interstellar flight...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.27,0:08:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I had no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.06,0:08:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Its name is the Yamato!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.07,0:08:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yamato?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.28,0:08:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,According to the capsule,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.45,0:08:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Iscandar is 168,000 light years from Earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.74,0:08:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,in the Large Magellanic Cloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.41,0:08:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,This journey, of 336,000 light years, will be a voyage
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.29,0:08:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,like none humanity has ever experienced.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.38,0:08:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't force you to come. Any who wish to stay may do so.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.34,0:08:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We set sail and leave port tomorrow at 0600.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.68,0:08:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I will assume that any who do not report at that time have decided to stay behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.27,0:08:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.19,0:08:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a shame. If only Yamamoto were still alive...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.07,0:08:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't say it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.32,0:09:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I will now announce the personnel in charge of each section.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.79,0:09:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Engine room: Hikozaemon Tokugawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.41,0:09:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Engineering: Shiro Sanada.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.79,0:09:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Major Sanada will also serve as second-in-command.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.05,0:09:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Next is Tactics: Susumu Kodai.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.93,0:09:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Him?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.26,0:09:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.77,0:09:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Navigation: Daisuke Shima.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.90,0:09:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.99,0:09:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what you're here for.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.78,0:09:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Then that makes this easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.78,0:09:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going no matter what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.70,0:09:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.83,0:09:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,With your body in that condition?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.91,0:09:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not blind.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.08,0:09:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,How many years have we known each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.50,0:09:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go instead. That takes courage, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.75,0:09:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,This voyage of 168,000 light years may take my life from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.72,0:10:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But I will go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.14,0:10:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I will go, and I will return!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.14,0:10:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. Then I've nothing else to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.56,0:10:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Please take care of Earth for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.53,0:10:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm told you'll also be on board the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.53,0:11:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I requested the pilot squad, like my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.53,0:11:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but you'll be assigned to accounting.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.09,0:11:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to go, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.39,0:11:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You're retiring in two months!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.06,0:11:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He asked me to go. That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.98,0:11:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Aiko, say goodbye to your grandfather.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.82,0:11:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.73,0:11:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Aiko... I'll be back. I'll be back, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.12,0:11:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Daisuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.58,0:11:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Jiro! What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.83,0:11:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom asked me to give you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.75,0:12:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,She said she forgot to give it to Dad,\Nso she's giving it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.26,0:12:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.88,0:12:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,She worries too much...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.26,0:12:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.56,0:12:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,So take care of Mom until then.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.27,0:12:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.13,0:12:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Riots in response to the Yamato Plan's announcement have worsened,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.11,0:12:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,and rioters have destroyed the Zone 7\NManagement Center Building with a bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.62,0:12:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The Far East Sector government is\Nasking rioters to remain calm, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.96,0:12:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be back, Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.30,0:12:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm worried...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.47,0:12:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The OMCS can make alcohol, so don't worry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.39,0:12:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,...for Mew!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.93,0:12:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.49,0:13:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,All inspections have been completed. All green.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.24,0:13:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,guide the vehicles carrying the crew to deck 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.58,0:13:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Maintenance and repair teams are to begin loading the planes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.25,0:13:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess this one goes to the autopilot room.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.68,0:13:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.85,0:13:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,All crew have boarded.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.94,0:13:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,None are missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.65,0:13:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,All that's left is the engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.69,0:13:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the Wave Motion Core.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.99,0:13:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,So this capsule is the last part we need?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.67,0:14:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The engine output has been confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.09,0:14:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Has the engine started?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.09,0:14:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we need a lot of power for that to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.22,0:14:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That's pretty mean of our goddess...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.72,0:14:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,All crew are to change into their uniforms after reporting in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.23,0:14:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow your superior's orders,\Nand remain on standby at your station.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.23,0:14:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Tactical Officer...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.41,0:14:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll obey your orders. Since you're my commanding officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.74,0:14:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But if I get any of the men killed for nothing,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.46,0:14:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll pay the price for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.96,0:14:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.17,0:14:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.93,0:14:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make it home... I'll make it home for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.44,0:15:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're on this ship, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.44,0:15:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. You're the tactical officer, Kodai, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.86,0:15:08.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the operations officer, Yuki Mori. Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.19,0:15:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's the captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.61,0:15:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.78,0:15:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Susumu Kodai.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.66,0:15:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.62,0:15:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.00,0:15:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.29,0:15:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir. It's about my position as tactical officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.30,0:15:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.13,0:15:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,...still don't have the right to accept it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.59,0:15:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,All of our candidates for section leaders died in yesterday's bombing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.97,0:15:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.22,0:15:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The man who was to sit in your seat was another one whom I killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.86,0:15:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Mamoru Kodai, your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.82,0:15:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I've examined your record.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.95,0:15:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And I've decided that you are more than capable of executing your mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.74,0:16:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The rest,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.25,0:16:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,you decide for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.25,0:16:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What's his deal? So rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.67,0:16:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.42,0:16:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is the first bridge?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.05,0:16:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Daisuke Shima, in charge of navigation. We've met before, haven't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.06,0:16:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The captain's above.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.48,0:16:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Kodai.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.11,0:16:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.49,0:16:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine. There's no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.49,0:16:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Executive Officer Sanada. All first bridge crew is here, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.83,0:16:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.79,0:16:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,All crew to your stations at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.38,0:16:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.38,0:16:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Confirm the situation with command.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.22,0:16:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Response from command.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.84,0:17:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,An interplanetary ballistic missile has been sighted heading for Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.01,0:17:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Its target is...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.10,0:17:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,this ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.56,0:17:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't set sail yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.60,0:17:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We need much more energy to launch the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.57,0:17:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The problem is where we get that energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.57,0:17:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.65,0:17:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll make it in time, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.24,0:17:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay calm!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.87,0:17:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Comms, get command on the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.00,0:17:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Captain Okita.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.04,0:17:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,How are we with the power supply?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.13,0:17:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We've begun routing all power from the Far East Sector to the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.89,0:17:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Whether that will be enough...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.85,0:17:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,All power in the Far East Sector is down!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.02,0:17:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Switch to backups.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.61,0:17:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Switching to backups.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.02,0:17:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Without power, we'll have to call off the launch.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.28,0:17:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander, look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.12,0:18:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yamazaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.62,0:18:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.74,0:18:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,North America, Africa, Eurasia...\NEvery sector is sending the Yamato energy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.87,0:18:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole world is sending power to the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.88,0:18:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.34,0:18:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It worked. We can fire up the engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.30,0:18:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Activate the Wave Motion Engine!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.64,0:18:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Activating engine. Connecting flywheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.39,0:18:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Pressure rising... 90%... 96%... 100%...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.48,0:18:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Energy charge at 120%.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.39,0:18:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Wave Motion Engine RPMs looking good. Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.78,0:18:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Interplanetary ballistic missile spotted!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.62,0:18:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise the ship! Remove the camouflage!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.59,0:19:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.68,0:19:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This ship was camouflaged to deceive the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.10,0:19:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Camouflage...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.85,0:19:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Then that sunken battleship we saw...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.31,0:19:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it was the Yamato...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.90,0:19:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Space Battleship Yamato!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.45,0:19:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We will shoot down the enemy's\Ninterplanetary ballistic missile here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.16,0:19:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to fire main cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.83,0:19:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,To your positions!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.33,0:19:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Set sail! Launch the Yamato!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.21,0:19:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Set sail! Launching the Yamato!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.79,0:20:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Shock cannon has finished receiving energy charge from the engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.25,0:20:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Clear sight on the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.29,0:20:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Begin automatic tracking.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.25,0:20:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Automatic tracking ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.27,0:20:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Lock on target. Correct for errors -1.3!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.11,0:20:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Target lock.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.48,0:20:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Open fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.36,0:20:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.54,0:21:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Power is coming back on line.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.97,0:21:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,The Yamato...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.13,0:21:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Did it melt and burn up in the atmosphere?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.14,0:21:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The Yamato is fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.04,0:21:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Releasing Wave Motion Shields. No damage to the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.17,0:21:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Kodai.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.47,0:21:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.80,0:21:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.51,0:21:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.81,0:24:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The time has come to set sail.\NThe Yamato heads for the planet of hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.03,0:24:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You... You are the only ones who can save Earth!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.57,0:24:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Cross the light barrier and fly, Yamato!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.08,0:24:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, the Yamato's true form is revealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.17,0:24:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What terrifying power does it hold?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.75,0:24:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time: Escaping the Mars Sphere.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.84,0:24:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,There are 364 days left until humanity becomes extinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.44,0:22:41.42,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Believe
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.42,0:22:45.89,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}A star will shine today
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.26,0:22:50.68,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Above your head
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.68,0:22:53.81,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Even far away
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.81,0:22:58.94,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}It pours down onto us
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.82,0:23:02.69,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}The same brilliance
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.69,0:23:08.99,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Surely it is the way to return
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.99,0:23:17.58,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}A small hope to light it up
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.26,0:23:24.59,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}To the sky you gaze upon
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.59,0:23:30.89,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}If I pray to eternity for a connection
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.89,0:23:38.98,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Even in days of sorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.98,0:23:43.15,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Can we meet once again?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.15,0:23:49.07,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,200)}The heart knows it is all right
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.07,0:23:59.13,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,3000)}Will it be a mutual promise?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.10,0:22:24.44,EP TS,,0,0,0,,{\fade(1500,2000)}{\blur7.5\3aH&90&\4aH&99&\pos(1157,840)}Episode 2
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.10,0:22:24.44,EP TS,,0,0,0,,{\fade(1500,2000)}{\blur7.5\3aH&90&\4aH&99&\pos(1157,1073)}Toward a Sea of Stars
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.74,0:03:04.24,Fade sign,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\fade(500,500)}{\pos(960,1035)}Pluto
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.06,0:03:09.77,Gamila,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\bord2\pos(960,942)}<Shouldn't we report this to Commander Goer, on planet Balan?>
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.39,0:03:13.10,Gamila,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\bord2\pos(960,942)}<We lost a carrier.>
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.44,0:03:18.48,Gamila,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\bord2\pos(960,942)}<And what do you think will happen if that opportunist reports this to headquarters?>
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.69,0:03:21.65,Gamila,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\bord2\pos(960,942)}<We'll deal with it ourselves.>
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.66,0:03:29.16,Gamila,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\bord2\pos(960,942)}<We'll destroy it from long range. Ready the planet bombs.>
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.37,0:03:30.54,Gamila,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\bord2\pos(960,942)}<Yes, sir!>
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.83,0:03:35.42,Gamila,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\bord2\pos(960,942)}<We cannot fail.>
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.13,0:12:25.51,TS Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord0\an8}Bombing at Zone 7 Management Center Building
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.84,0:14:04.07,TS Default,,0,0,0,,{\fade(250,0)\c&H5194B7&\3c&H3F4A94&\blur7\bord5\pos(939,79.5)\be2}Activate
